FerrionOS change to upstream RedoxFS (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 5ba45a6887374ab425326656a276bb3b62eba7dc after the existing recipe patches.

Creating, linking, removing and renaming an entry sets its directory's modification time to now, as POSIX file systems do; programs that cache a directory listing by its mtime (Python's importlib.metadata, which pip uses) otherwise never see the new entry.

